      "description": "Percent of commit notifications whose result was anything other than `success` (MVCC abort, ABORTED_SIGNATURE_INVALID, namespace policy reject, etc.) over the last 1m. Computed from `evm_loadgen_committed_total{result}`. Submission errors that never reach the committer are NOT counted here."
    },
